note draft

# SHELVED 2026-10-02 (base-v1-0019): a duplicate of code/channel.tree, which works on four backends. It declared tasks that bound nothing, so a call built clean and
# threw `stub` at run time; out of the build until it has bodies.


form channel
  link sender
  link receiver

task make
  take
    capacity
    like size
    fall 0
  like channel

task send
  note async
  take sender
  take data

task receive
  note async
  take receiver

task stream
  note async
  take receiver
  like list

task close
  take sender
